"description":"FocusKit helps you work with deeper focus, protect your time, and build a calmer daily rhythm.\n\nFeatures\n\nSmart Focus Sessions\nUse Pomodoro-style focus and break timers that fit the way you work. Stay productive, take better breaks, and keep your day balanced.\n\nProgress Tracking\nSee your focus time, patterns, streaks, goals, and long-term progress with clear charts and helpful insights.\n\nAlarms and Notifications\nNever lose track of time. FocusKit can alert you when a session ends, when a break begins, or when it is time to get back into flow.\n\nLive Activities\nFollow your current session from the Lock Screen or Dynamic Island without unlocking your iPhone.\n\nCategories\nOrganize sessions by project, task, or purpose so you can understand where your time really goes.\n\niCloud Sync\nKeep your sessions and categories in sync across your devices, with privacy and security built in.\n\nConsistency\nMaintain focus streaks, reach daily and weekly goals, and turn focused work into a lasting habit.\n\nHome Screen Widgets\nBring FocusKit to your Home Screen. Start, pause, or check your current session at a glance without opening the app. Choose from multiple widget sizes and styles, view your daily focus progress, track your streaks, and start a new session with a single tap.\n\nApple Watch\nTake FocusKit with you wherever you go. Start, pause, and end focus sessions from your wrist, get haptic feedback for session transitions and breaks, check the remaining time, switch categories on the fly, and keep your streak alive even when your iPhone is out of reach. Complications put your next focus session one tap away from any watch face.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.tryfocuskit.com/privacy/", "minimumOsVersion":"26.0", "releaseDate":"2025-11-28T08:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":47}]
